  "description": "CalCOFI hydrographic bottle observations (temperature, salinity, oxygen, nutrients and pigments) from 1949 to 2021, served live from the CalCOFI ERDDAP as tabledap. The table is long-format: one row per (sample, measurement_type), with `measurement_type` naming the quantity and `measurement_value` holding it, so a variable here is a value of `measurement_type`, not a column. Referenced in place for computing place statistics in the browser via tabledap.parquetWMeta.",
